123
00:09:03,890 --> 00:09:11,380
This data can then be used to create audience segments based on shared behaviors, and those segments can be targeted with relevant ads and content.

124
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:17,050
So it's a more nuanced approach that respects user privacy while still allowing for some level of personalization.

125
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:17,870
